# Castle OS Phase 1 — airootfs package set (x86_64)
# Minimal rescue set for the Phoenix Linux-rescue leg:
#  - file manager
#  - disk tools (inspect, clone, nuke, reinstall)
#  - network (so Castle backups can land on the network share)
#  - Wayland compositor for GUI mode
#
# NOTE: everything here must exist in the Arch repos named in pacman.conf.
# Keep dependencies minimal — all code is a liability, all packages are too.

## --- base / shell / editor ---
bash
sudo
openssh
git
vim
nano
less
man-db
man-pages
texinfo

## --- file manager ---
mc

## --- disk tools ---
arch-install-scripts
parted
gptfdisk
e2fsprogs
dosfstools
exfatprogs
ntfs-3g
smartmontools
hdparm
ddrescue
testdisk
rsync
pv
pigz
util-linux
lvm2
mdadm
cryptsetup
btrfs-progs

## --- network ---
networkmanager
wget
curl
bind
nmap

## --- wayland GUI mode (compositor + terminal) ---
sway
swaybg
foot
waybar
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
xorg-xwayland
polkit

## --- misc rescue ---
usbutils
pciutils
dmidecode
htop
tree
unzip
zip
